+// a weight that an op other than a matmul reads, directly or through a view (e.g. a codebook table shared by
+// GET_ROWS and the logits MUL_MAT), stays flat: tiling it in place would hand that op the tiled layout. The op may
+// run in an earlier or later graph split than the matmul, so the mark is kept on the tensor (HTP_TENSOR_KEEP_FLAT),
+// and a weight tiled before such a read is unpacked back.
